{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811520/extras/95d8901e66f5cebd4e7c5f4601229d06.avif?t=1752078806\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811520/extras_big/95d8901e66f5cebd4e7c5f4601229d06.avif?t=1752078806 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ZelastTank is a 2D online multiplayer game where tanks clash in explosive battle royale arenas. Fast-paced, strategic, and fun, every match is a fight to be the last one standing.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of unique tanks, dodge, attack, and adapt to maps that gradually shrink. Whether you're a casual player or a competitive warrior, ZeLastTank offers an accessible yet deep experience. Progress through a trophy system, earn coins, unlock tanks, and climb the global leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811520/extras/522d5d466ff2d8ab1d83d9ebe2783524.avif?t=1752078806\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811520/extras_big/522d5d466ff2d8ab1d83d9ebe2783524.avif?t=1752078806 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play instantly as a guest or create an account to save your progress and retrieve your tanks on any device. With stylized graphics, fast gameplay, and intense battles, ZeLastTank is perfect for quick sessions... or hours of all-out tank warfare !!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811520/extras/1d15b34733baf8014b802815321b1657.avif?t=1752078806\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811520/extras_big/1d15b34733baf8014b802815321b1657.avif?t=1752078806 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3811520?t=1752078806","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811520/3f4f78041fa043c9ff0f9ea2e6a9f7acbe77a447/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752078806","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811520/8a5f9ac81a2b35d5014d5d342cc53b95f2168ec8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752078806","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811520/8a5f9ac81a2b35d5014d5d342cc53b95f2168ec8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752078806","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811520/extras/95d8901e66f5cebd4e7c5f4601229d06.avif?t=1752078806\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811520/extras_big/95d8901e66f5cebd4e7c5f4601229d06.avif?t=1752078806 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ZelastTank is a 2D online multiplayer game where tanks clash in explosive battle royale arenas. Fast-paced, strategic, and fun, every match is a fight to be the last one standing.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of unique tanks, dodge, attack, and adapt to maps that gradually shrink. Whether you're a casual player or a competitive warrior, ZeLastTank offers an accessible yet deep experience. Progress through a trophy system, earn coins, unlock tanks, and climb the global leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811520/extras/522d5d466ff2d8ab1d83d9ebe2783524.avif?t=1752078806\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811520/extras_big/522d5d466ff2d8ab1d83d9ebe2783524.avif?t=1752078806 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play instantly as a guest or create an account to save your progress and retrieve your tanks on any device. With stylized graphics, fast gameplay, and intense battles, ZeLastTank is perfect for quick sessions... or hours of all-out tank warfare !!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811520/extras/1d15b34733baf8014b802815321b1657.avif?t=1752078806\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811520/extras_big/1d15b34733baf8014b802815321b1657.avif?t=1752078806 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","developers":["Ysn-production"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811520/b8ac8226a114956676c72bad77d9129a96567882/header.jpg?t=1752078806","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3811520/1655124151/c82ff4ff808e75913f0c069e0336135fc0c3d710/1750897045/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750906467","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3811520/1655124151/c82ff4ff808e75913f0c069e0336135fc0c3d710/1750897045/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750906467","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3811520/1655124151/c82ff4ff808e75913f0c069e0336135fc0c3d710/1750897045/hls_264_master.m